        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9464-US32D, Chicago 10mm Diameter Round Stainless Steel Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 3/8 Inch Diameter Chicago Stainless Steel Cabinet Pull is designed to accentuate any setting where a modern, sophisticated look is desired. Made from the highest grade material available, 10mm Diameter Round Stainless Steel Cabinet Pull is strong, durable, and resistant to corrosion as well as staining. Available in seven sizes from 4-5/16 inches to 28-3/8 inches overall length.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Brushed Stainless Steel 3/8 Inch Diameter Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 7 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9464/76-US32D</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Length center to center: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/8\" (10mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9464/96-US32D</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Length center to center: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/8\" (10mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9464/128-US32D</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Length center to center: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/8\" (10mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9464/192-US32D</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Length center to center: 7-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/8\" (10mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9464/320-US32D</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 14-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Length center to center: 12-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/8\" (10mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9464/448-US32D</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 20-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Length center to center: 17-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/8\" (10mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9464/640-US32D</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 28-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Length center to center: 25-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/8\" (10mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
